<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Baobab to distribute Mustek interest.</title>
<headline>Baobab to distribute Mustek interest.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Baobab Solid Growth Ltd said on Friday that it had decided to distribute its entire interest in Mustek Ltd to its shareholders by way of a renounceable share offer.</p>
<p>The firm said a further announcement would be made on the terms of the offer on March 7.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
